content.text:
I read "compact" as "commit": everything in `../packages-over-time` is now one commit, `d3d1fa8` on `main`, not pushed. It includes the code, data, outputs, figures and `.Rout` logs, the same way this repo keeps them. The largest file is under 3 MB. If you meant something else by "compact", tell me.

In this repo, `programs/11_get_crossref.R` now has:
- the `cursor_max = 100000` fix;
- the print ISSNs for JEL (`0022-0515`) and JEP (`0895-3309`);
- duplicate removal by DOI before the existing filters, because adding print ISSNs can return the same work twice.

I also removed `data/crossref/issns.Rds` from git so the new ISSN list is rebuilt on your rerun. These changes in this repo are not committed.
